<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 19.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Dec 19.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day (upto 0640 GMT) and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at 0640 GMT was 3007.25, 5.71 points or 0.19 percent higher than Wednesday's close.</p>
